  "notes": "Slot rectangles are measured against the canonical 1024x1536 page art; card title/description patches are per-field and should only activate on CMS field changes. Current backgrounds sampled from local paper margins row-by-row; glyph paths are exact source crops for QA, not transparent glyphs. CleanPatch v2 assets use localized generated cleanup context and are used only for changed copy; the original full-page source stays the default. CleanPatch v2 fills only the detected source glyph strokes with context-matched cream-paper cleanup; all pixels outside the expanded source-ink mask remain original. Used only when a CMS copy value differs from the source. Hidden-record patch fields are fullCardMask/fullCardMaskRect in source page coordinates; render below remaining foreground photo cards. Photo replacement uses photoViewportPolygon in card-image-local-px and photoFrameOverlay above it; source .exp-card remains the default. The fullCardMask patch must be clipped to fullCardMaskPolygon in fullCardMaskRect-local-px, leaving alpha transparent outside the card silhouette so surrounding paper, collage, and handwritten artwork remain visible. The card silhouette polygons are source-aligned approximations and should be checked against a live changed-image screenshot before publication. Frame overlay PNGs were regenerated from the exact canonical source page crop; alpha is limited to a 4px light edge ring outside the photo polygon, excluding baked caption/neighbour content. Card polygons are measured against the 1024px source art and require live changed-image verification."
